# A global ignore rule for the Finder "Icon" resource-fork stub matches this
# directory case-insensitively (core.ignorecase); un-ignore it explicitly.
!Design/icon/

# Release build products. The DMG is uploaded to a GitHub release rather
# than committed, and the intermediate archive and notary logs are large
# and rebuildable.
dist/
.build-release/
# Generated installer backgrounds. The one source asset beside them, the
# capture of the real drawer, is committed.
Design/Installer/background*

# Finder resource-fork stubs, which appear whenever a folder gets a
# custom icon and are never wanted here.
Icon?
artifacts/
